            {
                "markdown": "• Download videos, audio, Shorts, and post images.\r\n- Enjoy full-speed 🚀 downloads with a built-in Download Manager.\r\n- Built in a modern Video and Audio player.\r\n- Built in custom Sleeptimer.\r\n- Import videos to Photos or directly into the YTKPlus library.\r\n- Block all advertisements for a clean experience.\r\n- 🎯 Fixes Playback 'Something went wrong' Exclusive.\r\n- Play media in the background.\r\n- Stream HD videos over Wi-Fi, 3G, 4G, or 5G.\r\n- Streaming and downloading 2k-4k videos on Supported Device ip15 and later.\r\n- Set default playback quality for Wi-Fi and Cellular.\r\n- Customize or hide tab bar icons and layouts.\r\n- Includes built-in SponsorBlock integration.\r\n- Picture in Picture (PiP).\r\n- And many more settings…\r\n- Supports iPadOS.",
